lor:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by Rebecca Sramkova (@rebbsramkova)</a></p></div></blockquote>\r\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p>In Samsun, a home champion was crowned as Ayla Aksu defeated Lucrezia Stefanini 7-5, 2-6, 6-2 in the final to lift her first WTA 125 trophy. The 30-year-old is enjoying a career-best season in which she's also been the Figueira da Foz WTA 125 runner-up, won her first tour-level match since 2017 in Prague and made her Grand Slam qualifying debut at the US Open. This week, Aksu soars 54 places to a new career high of No. 156, while Stefanini is up 19 spots to No. 106.</p>\n<p>Meanwhile, Anna Blinkova made the Samsun semifinals via a 6-3, 6-4 defeat of Bianca Andreescu in the quarterfinals, and is up 16 places to No. 73.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n        <aside class=\"instagram-post embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--floating embeddable-widget--centered-mobile \"><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeXTPWUii0c/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeXTPWUii0c/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> <div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\"> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14p